stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Disconnected

    Disconnected --> Connecting: Start()<br/>(spawn connect-loop fiber)
    Connecting --> Connected: 物理连接成功<br/>(Generation +1，切内层 TcpTransport)
    Connecting --> Reconnecting: 连接超时/失败<br/>(abort + deleteLater)
    Connecting --> Connecting: 端点热更新<br/>(掐断当前尝试，立即以新端点重试)

    Connected --> Reconnecting: 对端断连<br/>(waitForDisconnected 唤醒)
    Reconnecting --> Connecting: 退避到期<br/>(1s×2 上限 30s ±20% jitter)
    Reconnecting --> Reconnecting: 端点热更新<br/>(重置退避级别)

    Connected --> Disconnected: RequestClose / Close
    Connecting --> Disconnected: RequestClose / Close
    Reconnecting --> Disconnected: RequestClose / Close
    Disconnected --> [*]

    note right of Connected
        稳定 ≥ stable_reset_after 后
        下次断开重置退避级别；
        node 侧 reactor 观察本状态机
        的下降沿做代际隔离
    end note
